        <head>SERMON BY THE RECTOR.</head>
        <p>SERMON BY THE RECTOR.</p>
        <p>Th. Rector nrrachrd a sermon based on woris con- tained in verses 14, 15, and 24 of the fifth chapter of Amos. In the coqrsa of his rem irks he said throughont the land there had hen an elntian of chief magistrate in the erea'; towns and boroughs, And he wished first of all. on an cccasion like that, to pass a tribute of hraise to the Mayor whose ter:n of office had :igat =lei, for his</p>
